                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "74f90279-5d47-31d4-9104-0dd5f9cf3e40",
                        "entry_id": "e0ad1660-e306-3d38-81a2-40ac5c523021",
                        "glosses": [
                            "forest ranger"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c70b90c-83de-41da-9f47-af047d2aa5a9",
                                "sense_id": "74f90279-5d47-31d4-9104-0dd5f9cf3e40",
                                "text": "Больша́я ста́рая овча́рка грязно-бе́лого цве́та, лохма́тая, с кло́чьями ше́рсти у глаз и но́са, стара́ясь каза́ться равноду́шной к прису́тствию чужи́х, ра́за три поко́йно обошла́ вокру́г ло́шади и вдруг неожи́данно, с зло́бным, ста́рческим хрипе́ньем бро́силась сза́ди на объе́здчика, оста́льные соба́ки не вы́держали и повскака́ли со свои́х мест.",
                                "translation": "A big shaggy old sheep-dog of a dirty white colour with woolly tufts about its nose and eyes walked three times quietly round the horse, trying to seem unconcerned in the presence of strangers, then all at once dashed suddenly from behind at the overseer with an angry aged growl; the other dogs could not refrain from leaping up too.",
                                "english": "A big shaggy old sheep-dog of a dirty white colour with woolly tufts about its nose and eyes walked three times quietly round the horse, trying to seem unconcerned in the presence of strangers, then all at once dashed suddenly from behind at the overseer with an angry aged growl; the other dogs could not refrain from leaping up too."
                            }
                        ]
